*> ********************************************************
*> PROGRAM : CRD0010
*> PURPOSE : CREDIT APPROVAL RULES
*> AUTHOR  : D.P.
*> CHANGE LOG:
*>   1992-03-10 ORIGINAL VERSION
*>   2009-11-01 THRESHOLDS UPDATED PER AUDIT REQ 202
*> RUN FROM JCL JOB CRDNIGHT STEP020
*> ********************************************************
IDENTIFICATION DIVISION.
PROGRAM-ID. CRD0010.
DATA DIVISION.
WORKING-STORAGE SECTION.
01 IN-RECORD.
    *> BUREAU CREDIT SCORE
    05 CR-SCORE           PIC 9(3).
    *> DEBT TO INCOME RATIO
    05 DEBT-RATIO         PIC 9V99.
    05 RUN-DATE           PIC 9(8).
    05 RUN-DATE-R REDEFINES RUN-DATE.
       10 RUN-DATE-YYYY  PIC 9(4).
       10 RUN-DATE-MM    PIC 9(2).
       10 RUN-DATE-DD    PIC 9(2).
    05 FILLER             PIC X(4).
01 OUT-RECORD.
    *> A=APPROVE R=REFER D=DECLINE
    05 CREDIT-DECN        PIC X VALUE 'D'.
        88 CREDIT-APPROVED VALUE 'A'.
        88 CREDIT-DECLINED VALUE 'D'.
PROCEDURE DIVISION.
MAIN-PARA.
    ACCEPT IN-RECORD
    PERFORM 2000-SCORE-DECISION
    DISPLAY "CREDIT-DECN=" CREDIT-DECN
    STOP RUN.
2000-SCORE-DECISION.
    *>  OLD CHECK REMOVED 2004
    *>  IF CR-SCORE >= 560
    *>      PERFORM 9000-OLD-HANDLING
    *>  END-IF
    *> AUTOMATIC APPROVAL - LIMIT 1050 PER 1998 POLICY
    IF CR-SCORE >= 700 AND DEBT-RATIO < 0.43
        SET CREDIT-APPROVED TO TRUE
    *> REFER TO UNDERWRITER - LIMIT 310 PER 1998 POLICY
    ELSE IF CR-SCORE >= 620
        MOVE 'R' TO CREDIT-DECN
    ELSE
        SET CREDIT-DECLINED TO TRUE
    END-IF
    END-IF.
